Hi MaClaw,

Our legal team is reviewing the **NDA template** from our partner **TechNova Solutions** (URL: [https://docs.technova-solutions.com/legal/nda-v3.pdf](https://docs.technova-solutions.com/legal/nda-v3.pdf)). However, they’d like to extract the **plain text version** of the main clauses (Sections 1–5) from the **company’s public NDA page** ([https://www.technova-solutions.com/legal/standard-nda](https://www.technova-solutions.com/legal/standard-nda)). Could you:
1. Fetch the webpage content, **ignoring the sidebar and footer**;
2. Save the extracted text to `/legal/technova/nda_clauses.txt` **without HTML tags**;
3. If the page uses **AJAX**, let me know so I can adjust the request headers.

Thanks in advance!

MaClaw,

For our upcoming **Q3 financial review**, the finance team needs the **2024 H1 earnings summary** from **Tencent’s investor relations page** ([https://ir.tencent.com/financials/earnings-reports](https://ir.tencent.com/financials/earnings-reports)). Specifically:
- Extract the **plain text** of the **2024 H1 earnings press release** (avoid HTML tags);
- Save it to `/finance/tencent/earnings/2024_h1.txt`;
- If the page requires **login**, use the **pre-stored credentials** in `/secrets/ir_tencent.json`;
- **Bonus**: If possible, fetch the **earlier Q4 2023 report** from the same URL path (`/financials/earnings-reports?year=2023&quarter=4`) and save it to the same directory.

Time-sensitive—let me know if delays are expected.

MaClaw,

The **R&D team** is analyzing competitor patents from **State Intellectual Property Office (SIPO) China** ([https://sipo.gov.cn](https://sipo.gov.cn)). They need:
- The **full text of the latest 50 patents** under **keyword "AI chip design"** (search URL: [https://sipo.gov.cn/sipo/patent/search/advanced](https://sipo.gov.cn/sipo/patent/search/advanced));
- **Save each patent as a PDF** to `/research/competitor_patents/ai_chips/`;
- **Extract abstracts and claims** (if available) and append them to `/research/competitor_patents/ai_chips/abstracts.txt` in **JSONL format** (one JSON per line).

**Note**: The search requires **manual input**—please **simulate typing** the keyword and clicking search (use `pyautogui` if needed). Let me know if delays are expected due to CAPTCHA.

MaClaw,

Urgent: The **PR team** needs the **full transcript** of the **2024 Global Tech Summit keynote** from **Huawei’s official site** ([https://www.huawei.com/en/tech-summit/2024/keynote](https://www.huawei.com/en/tech-summit/2024/keynote)).

**Requirements**:
- Extract the **speaker’s slides + audio transcript** (if available);
- Save slides as **PPTX** to `/pr/huawei/2024/slides.pptx`;
- Save transcript (if text-only) to `/pr/huawei/2024/transcript.txt`;
- **Bypass paywall** (if any) using the **proxy settings** in `/config/proxies.json` (key: `huawei_official`);
- **If the page uses WebAssembly**, ensure the fetch respects **CORS headers**.

**Deadline**: By **17:00 (CST) today**. Let me know if you encounter issues.

MaClaw,

For the **legal audit**, we need to extract the **full terms of service** for **Meituan’s business platform** ([https://biz.meituan.com/legal/tos](https://biz.meituan.com/legal/tos)).

**Specifics**:
- **Parse the ToS into structured JSON**, with keys like:
  ```json
  {
    "section": "Payment Terms",
    "content": "[extracted text]",
    "clause_number": "3.2"
  }
  ```
- Save to `/legal/meituan/biz_tos_structured.json`;
- **If the ToS is split across multiple pages**, follow all pagination links;
- **Check for embedded PDFs** (e.g., "Chinese version") and save them to `/legal/meituan/pdfs/`;
- **Note**: Meituan may **rate-limit requests**—use **random delays (3–7 sec)** between requests.

**Priority**: Medium—let me know if you need adjustments.
